The irony in this post considering we probably would have had already had CLARITY if Coinbase/Armstrong hadn't killed it back in January 2026.

Instead, it's now political theatre with a less than 10% chance of happening in our opinion.

@DavidNage has been one of the few honest voices -- over the last two months he's written countless pieces https://www.ar.ca/blog showing how this is dead on arrival.

translation.text:
这篇文章的讽刺之处在于，如果 Coinbase/Armstrong 没有在 2026 年 1 月杀死它，我们可能已经有了 CLARITY。

相反，我们认为这现在是一场政治戏剧，发生的可能性不到 10%。

@DavidNage 是为数不多的诚实声音之一——在过去的两个月里，他写了无数的文章 https://www.ar.ca/blog 来展示这是如何在到达时就死掉的。

nodes.content:
Last month, after burning through 61B DeepSeek tokens hunting bugs, here's where I've landed on CLI agents:

@cline - reasoning and tool use are on another level.
codex - solid tool use, decent reasoning.
@claude_code - great overall, but API calls randomly die in the middle of a hunt.
@opencode - good reasoning, but memory management needs work.
CodeWhale - good reasoning and tool use, but API reliability is hit or miss.
@Wrong_Stack - excellent orchestration, though API calls can be flaky sometimes.

translation.text:
上个月，在通过 61B DeepSeek 代币寻找 bug 后，我找到了 CLI 代理：

@cline - 推理和工具使用处于另一个层面。
codex - 可靠的工具使用，合理的推理。
@claude_code - 总体来说很棒，但是 API 调用会在狩猎过程中随机终止。
@opencode - 很好的推理，但内存管理需要工作。
CodeWhale - 良好的推理和工具使用，但 API 可靠性时好时坏。
@Wrong_Stack - 出色的编排，尽管 API 调用有时可能不稳定。
